    "body": "The reference count fields, such as `ob_tid` and `ob_ref_shared`, may be accessed concurrently in the free threading build by a `_Py_TryXGetRef` or similar operation. The PyObject header fields will be initialized by `_PyObject_Init`, so only call `memset()` to zero-initialize the remainder of the allocation.\r\n\n\n<!-- gh-issue-number: gh-130019 -->\n* Issue: gh-130019\n<!-- /gh-issue-number -->\n",
